/// - `kafka_key`
/// - `kafka_topic`
/// - `kafka_partition`
/// - `kafka_offset`
/// - `kafka_lag`: Set only when `consumer_group` is set.
/// - `kafka_timestamp_ms`
/// - `kafka_timestamp_unix`
/// - `kafka_tombstone_message`
/// - All record headers
///
/// Status: stable
